{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1014_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b48bf40a3e36d9a2d8093ea5d38b458693430d214647f0f754fca0f7eb854f58", "ja": "これが、私の新しい曲……。", "zh": "这就是，我的新歌……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
