{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1021_021mat", "source_sha256": "43e98896646d262e1462c4f01dd700dc34091059b834ec2753eb12b05b4fff19", "ja": "ほ？　……大変なのです！\n風花ちゃん、急ぐのです！", "zh": "咦？……不好了！\n风花，快点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1022_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9dc9a893780e4eefa934eb9d162a21c67bf8bf92552e897bdede2f651f27f01c", "ja": "う、うん。でも……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1023_p", "source_sha256": "36528304c8f69dbaea6a0769dc15aae3625f29e78432515510f27c300eae94f8", "ja": "あれ？\nまつりと風花、この後何かあるのか？", "zh": "哎？\n茉莉和风花，之后有什么安排吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1024_021mat", "source_sha256": "b8577a242da22131197484d3da2fd3607af5f5a7ff0343f26a079e5c1182d45e", "ja": "まつりと風花ちゃんは、お仕事なのです。この前、\nお天気が悪くてリスケになった撮影が、今日なのです。", "zh": "玛茨莉和风花今天有工作哦。之前因为天气不好而改期的拍摄，就是今天。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1025_p", "source_sha256": "0d9632e5b9bd26204b4458ad9ebfc60bde2d3c6c455c8111304f3c2893ff6bb5", "ja": "そ、そうだったのか。\n風花、さっきの話だけど……。", "zh": "原、原来是这样啊。\n风花，关于刚才的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1026_041fuk", "source_sha256": "64638f73cdd80f5e2c8c2f2448175663def2076a81f916ab9db14b88bd71d8bc", "ja": "え、ええと、あの……。\nすみません、やっぱり後にしてもらえませんか？", "zh": "呃、呃，这个……那个……\n对不起，还是请您之后再说，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1027_041fuk", "source_sha256": "fc120eb485d69baf879a7b162a0de851976013a619d4e20bc959d282b31a48bc", "ja": "もう向かわないとなので……失礼します！", "zh": "我已经该过去了……先失礼了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1028_021mat", "source_sha256": "6659ea1d9b94d36121f5a8af92d72ce026e704413b17d666e014079fc5be1e34", "ja": "あっ、風花ちゃん！？\n{$P$}さん、いってくるのです！", "zh": "啊，风花！？\n{$P$}先生，茉莉这就过去哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1029_p", "source_sha256": "e29ab2e08f70fb122b2a086007080d0d0c0e8b711165d3554c841b462986d1e6", "ja": "あ、ああ！　気をつけてな！", "zh": "啊、啊啊！路上小心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1030_p", "source_sha256": "103042be17bc4bc2373166b5f36126257791ca791daa7ed173e1db70536b8558", "ja": "うーん……なんだかタイミングが合わないというか、\n風花に避けられてるような気がするな……。", "zh": "嗯……总觉得时机对不上，还是怎么的，\n感觉风花好像在躲着我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1031_009rit", "source_sha256": "3b64035e4063bafd57e17508edfdaf2b598cf2fd120f4c17e0134b467cce8b18", "ja": "{$P$}。\nもしかして、まだ風花さんと話せてないんですか？", "zh": "{$P$}。\n难道说，您还没能和风花小姐说上话吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1032_p", "source_sha256": "cc3b292c58df8fbb72d3f2c04b71b51d78ecf15e200c113a0fc04d62e5d8e88e", "ja": "それがあの後、ずっと留守電で……\nメールは返ってきたから、今日直接と思ったんだけど。", "zh": "可是从那之后一直都只有语音信箱留言……\n虽然邮件收到了回复，但我本来想今天直接和她谈的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1033_048rei", "source_sha256": "331c6fda2bf86e5851f635c533eda697b53c1dc72bf6278acaf64609f4e24b97", "ja": "なるほど～。でもでも、大切なお話は、\nあんまり先に延ばしちゃダメですよ？", "zh": "原来如此～不过，不过，重要的事情可不能一直拖下去哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1034_p", "source_sha256": "28d6978d598284ec742d2dffeed390c853e292fa1f88d02b71f30eb5634c4cb1", "ja": "うっ……そうだな。", "zh": "唔……也是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1035_052kao", "source_sha256": "14dd9988262ce2438eb9d127d10481c3e8858d0190f2c46ec82fa26499546d10", "ja": "{$P$}さん。私と麗花ちゃん、\n今晩、風花ちゃんと食事の約束をしているんです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生。我和丽花，\n今晚约了风花一起吃饭。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1036_052kao", "source_sha256": "c4e3eb25c7a85fff2a1f62c682c5ae070a6df9a1605e3726fe81c6f6232cd643", "ja": "その時に、すこし話を聞いてみますね。\n誤解しているなら、そうじゃないって……。", "zh": "到时候，我会稍微打听一下的。\n如果是误会，我会告诉她不是这样的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1037_p", "source_sha256": "efdb24c496ea72c8998db03ea74a912c1bf31e862dddc8df7f4fb42c98507d78", "ja": "歌織さん……ありがとうございます。\nすみませんが、お願いします。", "zh": "歌织……谢谢你。\n不好意思，拜托了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1038_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ebe4aec8188b9f836e1c6884190d28e648d64747e8e7aac21977fdf7227a8f82", "ja": "はぁ～……。", "zh": "唉～……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1039_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5bc18852074546f1f3d8be7cf2684bb8f4ba0a0a5dc774deec560bf3b70da4f6", "ja": "……あっ。ご、ごめんなさい！\nなんでもないんです！", "zh": "……啊。对、对不起！\n没什么的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1040_052kao", "source_sha256": "a4735b5598a21dc15625f3a57fa84284e4045a93c33e24e7849df38adaf3d2b0", "ja": "ねえ、風花ちゃん。\n{$P$}さんのことなんだけど……。", "zh": "那个，风花。关于{$P$}先生的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1041_041fuk", "source_sha256": "01449ac06c889da828d89edc4eef014a6647205330f8e725db5bf13805b4cc85", "ja": "えっ！？　私、{$P$}さんの\n話だなんて、言いましたっけ？", "zh": "诶！？我有说过是在聊{$P$}先生吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1042_048rei", "source_sha256": "b4a7e85cbbab39b31869aa57ceec5301578fdac123f32d0a613bd4095fa06536", "ja": "バレバレですよ、風花さん♪　それより、どうして\n{$P$}さんから逃げてるんですか？", "zh": "太明显了，风花小姐♪　话说回来，你为什么要从{$P$}先生那里逃走呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1043_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1342d3060bbf90c9df4f10100f4d6deceb0a64345ee6b1676a2f456bf884fbb3", "ja": "に、逃げてる……うう、そうだよね。\n逃げてるよね、私……。", "zh": "我、我是在逃避……呜呜，确实是这样呢。\n我是在逃避，对吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1044_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f26b2204afc27cb54ffaf7eeef8da0168b5d0f3f0247eb9e6e425f0f129297ff", "ja": "実は私……昨日、{$P$}さんに、\n「バカ！」って言っちゃったんです……。", "zh": "其实我……昨天对{$P$}先生说了句“大笨蛋！”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1045_052kao", "source_sha256": "a7449a06b796c2b371c6d574ef7e6fea79f03200c33fdfbcd76394ed91625ac7", "ja": "まあ……そうなの？", "zh": "哎呀……是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1046_041fuk", "source_sha256": "29548e045bb43d54c875d95ddb6638ab0d68f8e41c2002b6b412773cfe28e6d4", "ja": "いくらなんでも、子どもっぽかったって反省してます。\nでも、また水着のお仕事かと思ったらショックで……。", "zh": "再怎么说，我也确实太孩子气了，正在反省呢。  \n不过，一想到又是泳装工作，我就受到了打击……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1047_052kao", "source_sha256": "491e71e1fd85c7e7e7836b0bd85bfa4c4dbcc2c14d72316ac1ca610633a20781", "ja": "やっぱり、その事だったのね。だったら尚更、\n{$P$}さんと話したほうがいいわ。", "zh": "果然是那件事啊。既然如此，就更应该和{$P$}先生谈谈了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1048_052kao", "source_sha256": "2bfa49535734544599f6f1e6172376975fab0c9dedfe1865cd87500340c9e1c9", "ja": "今回は少なくとも、風花ちゃんが\n思っているようなお仕事じゃないみたいだから。", "zh": "因为这次至少，看起来不像是风花以为的那种工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1049_041fuk", "source_sha256": "07442ece04ae92a5bba662d3d6b1bf4b9fc9c6b4f9a61e7375a7d31385969c92", "ja": "えっ……そ、そうなんですか？", "zh": "咦……是、是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1050_052kao", "source_sha256": "443db0ad1d98fea6c6971dbbb20eb6047bdd5b98219e2c119f419e708e032992", "ja": "ええ。女性誌のお仕事だって言ってたわ。", "zh": "嗯。她说是女性杂志的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1051_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f1ba91cdac52abbcee510600e276ff8a8a9a5beec822e9ddb4764e652686e796", "ja": "女性誌？\nなら、どうして水着の話なんて……。", "zh": "女性杂志？\n那为什么会聊起泳装的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1052_048rei", "source_sha256": "ebb65e2e7eeb7b6be35c9caf5bb2ba82512333ec4e40c45de1d96bc657af80b2", "ja": "うーん、たしかにそうですよね？　だったら、\n{$P$}さんに聞いてみないと。", "zh": "嗯——确实是这样呢？既然如此，就得去问问{$P$}先生了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1053_048rei", "source_sha256": "92f1d1541a144c2660cd0fa4ef14de7660b1c9a6c0220bef144e82a49fd55509", "ja": "風花さん、思い立ったらすぐ行動ですよ！\nドーンと、思いきって電話しちゃいましょう♪", "zh": "风花小姐可是想到就马上行动的类型哦！我们就大胆一点，直接打电话吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1054_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b6278a17e8f5064f3516f829f67c1922645957dca38a29998d653e76118bafbd", "ja": "ええっ、電話って……今！？\nそんなのムリだよ、麗花ちゃん！", "zh": "诶诶，打电话……现在吗！？\n那种事我做不到啦，丽花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1055_048rei", "source_sha256": "f371b4dc332c39783f6c536abe82e9da6f01875332376455c30cc51a027500b7", "ja": "でもでも、先延ばししても、苦しいだけですよ？", "zh": "可是可是，一直拖下去也只会更难受吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1056_041fuk", "source_sha256": "0211af212d8b9bd2f9f9ea194ec47441db810a7ec3cea6b2614d1de96da0347f", "ja": "うう、そうだよね……わ、わかった。\n明日、{$P$}さんと話してみる……。", "zh": "呜呜，你说得对……我、我知道了。\n明天，我去跟{$P$}先生谈谈看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1057_041fuk", "source_sha256": "68ff1acbea0f76063b675bd005da87d1868bde960b1a870409fa3c3f7f954196", "ja": "私……{$P$}さんのこと誤解してた？\nど、どうしよう！　失礼なこと言っちゃった……。", "zh": "我……误解了{$P$}先生吗？\n这、这可怎么办！说了那么失礼的话……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1058_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e89e708ce52a946736f672c090e5153ac90c9177154ce980b264707e776ea2a7", "ja": "電話して、謝ろうかな。でも、なんていえば……\nやっぱり、直接話そう……。", "zh": "要不要打电话道歉呢？可是，该怎么说才好……果然还是当面说吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1059_null", "source_sha256": "de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481", "ja": "翌日……", "zh": "隔天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1060_se", "source_sha256": "c01f9901aa06ad650b314d5a929022d1574a5f17402b31fd5bd6359592e719d6", "ja": "コンコン、ガチャ", "zh": "咚咚，咔嚓", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1061_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1c7957a3e9ed29606df5bc95f459e68114dc0cb2214aa5e409683bf4c517421f", "ja": "失礼します。{$P$}さん……\nい、いないのかぁ。ホッ……", "zh": "打扰了。{$P$}先生……\n不、不在啊。呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1062_041fuk", "source_sha256": "50185262568a36cee30f5a77f20ef604e0dc7796f5544b9e3df612597cce34e0", "ja": "って、私ったら、ホッとしてる場合じゃないのに。\n{$P$}さんと話をしないと……。", "zh": "话说，我怎么能在这里松口气呢。\n还得和{$P$}先生谈谈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1063_se", "source_sha256": "b12709ece634544d32af67a926a9d0555729b694be2ce9963a7d8ef771034632", "ja": "プルルルル……", "zh": "嘟噜噜噜噜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1064_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9134a6320a000337035b49e9d3cdbf9463748b1264398983d009109639ede0a6", "ja": "あれ、電話……\nえ、{$P$}さんから！？", "zh": "咦，电话……\n诶，是{$P$}先生打来的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1065_p", "source_sha256": "4b1ef05ed32d3d8043935eaa75e65e24e0844ff0c58b745b23e91aa1786d987a", "ja": "お、今日は電話が繋がるみたいだ。\n本当は直接会って話したいけど、早い方がいいし……", "zh": "哦，今天电话好像能打通。\n其实我也想直接见面聊，不过还是越快越好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1066_041fuk", "source_sha256": "841f476c61dc83ea1130c1cd6526c4cf12ad794c6492f6ec688dd744f6da4567", "ja": "『も、もしもし……？』", "zh": "“喂、喂……？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1067_p", "source_sha256": "53711ad99c03d38b1bf7736f2ac3c585b0ae1f9d22272ef33d1e74cd725fe5af", "ja": "お疲れさま、風花！　何度もごめんな。\n実は風花に……。", "zh": "辛苦了，风花！一直打扰你，真不好意思。\n其实我想跟风花……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1068_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9a89506a6b2e2756f4b60b20346dbacd80a8d18826453c15cda4ab08b7c96106", "ja": "『わ、私！　{$P$}さんに……！』", "zh": "『我、我！　想对{$P$}先生……！』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1069_041fuk", "source_sha256": "7058035ef627b8a0cb3d35d17b9be4f06fc3ef58a70f280ca8b23cbc6530add9", "ja": "『話したいことがあって……えっ？』\n／話したいことがあって……えっ？", "zh": "『我有件事想和你说……咦？』\n／我有件事想和你说……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1070_p", "source_sha256": "61670d50ff6cb1b2066112d8411db6119538c3443458f61c0882b3a26e2344c9", "ja": "話したいことがあって……えっ？", "zh": "有话想说……啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1071_041fuk", "source_sha256": "cb4dd13c3aabf423e878419d02490a6626ac83e6ad10ed3100892cec9b4a2e35", "ja": "『あっ、ご、ごめんなさいっ！　あの、どうぞ！』", "zh": "“啊，对、对不起！那个，您先请！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1072_p", "source_sha256": "550631adfea6b2ca8388e5314c9950fb09e4504e87bc222e1cefd404e65b93a1", "ja": "いや、大丈夫だよ。\nそれより、風花の話って？　先にどうぞ！", "zh": "没事，没关系的。\n比起这个，风花要说的是什么事？你先说吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1073_041fuk", "source_sha256": "0aadea5acdd87e90b160d735a398bd2916b02c395ed1ad857dd870ef62d25f77", "ja": "『い、いえいえ！　私は後でいいですから。\n{$P$}さんから、お先に……』", "zh": "“没、没有的事！我之后再说就好。\n还是请{$P$}先生先……”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1074_p", "source_sha256": "231651b235f08646311196130b7a2db24d28a90999feae8bcdf88d2dadf317fc", "ja": "そうか？　それじゃ、お言葉に甘えて。\nこの前言ってた、新しい仕事の事なんだけど……。", "zh": "是吗？那我就不客气了。\n关于之前提到的新工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1075_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6ccb59c0f221ed4956058f30b634a072977d7211a575d9256a2b21d6e1aef027", "ja": "『ごくっ。は、はい……』", "zh": "（吞口水）是、是的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1076_staff", "source_sha256": "fcc0dbcc9f414e9fbaf376d933a06bc6a1aada4240ee09d962bacfa96846cdd2", "ja": "765プロさん、すみませーん！　急で申し訳ない、\nセット変更あったんで打ち合わせお願いします！", "zh": "765事务所各位，不好意思～！临时通知很抱歉，\n布景有所变更，麻烦大家来对接一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1077_p", "source_sha256": "3563c05707f8f77dd3b8e448865d48ed0e753a82f0a8cc405bc5c3d0fcc9ebbc", "ja": "ええっ！？　わ、わかりました、すぐ行きます！　\nご、ごめん、風花！　急用で……後でかけ直す！", "zh": "诶！？好、好的，我马上过去！\n对、对不起，风花！临时有急事……我之后再打给你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1078_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1332475d414d6c69cae735594b553532360914d66cc6dd38f53b155f654a4341", "ja": "『え？　ええっ！？\nあのっ、{$P$}さ……』", "zh": "『诶？诶诶！？\n那个，{$P$}先……』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1079_se", "source_sha256": "5fc25a669e66c36e21d3fea2a71ab477b49d65f2a87361caf83be78fdc13eea7", "ja": "ガチャッ、ツーッ、ツーッ……", "zh": "咔哒、嘟——嘟——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1080_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c3c29f1f2c7de4dc2a45d35460a6aacfafb655084e87c50a473d392461c4bc45", "ja": "き、切れちゃった……。", "zh": "断、断掉了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1081_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a7d2fb098da0aa0867779fea498524832b059f67ffa49b99b6f230858fb17e9f", "ja": "また、ちゃんと話せなかった……。\nどうしていつもすれ違っちゃうんだろう……はあ……。", "zh": "又没能好好说上话……\n为什么总是和对方错过呢……唉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1082_052kao", "source_sha256": "9b2c67e99dd40f57e6de6db1a94d8aa6014eb52366554473a6e4e34e7b348e50", "ja": "風花ちゃん、{$P$}さんと\nまだ話せてないみたい……。", "zh": "风花好像还没能和{$P$}先生说上话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1083_009rit", "source_sha256": "c4393ec7303f6422e4f8c723c97b57ec60722f7b22197b0477b382830df2761a", "ja": "どういうわけか、間の悪い時ってありますからね。", "zh": "不知怎么的，总会有碰上时机不巧的时候呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1084_021mat", "source_sha256": "fccb06256f96b70e4c06222bdba335502b20cdb3b1cf12b5f81ead9bf0f8f11b", "ja": "むう……姫はなんだか、じれったいのです。\nこうなったら、まつりたちが一肌脱ぐしかないのです！", "zh": "唔……公主总觉得有点按捺不住了呢。\n既然这样，就只有由茉莉她们来助一臂之力了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1085_048rei", "source_sha256": "74f21b343d529be99858a26778498df868cd6ab4ee53c00252f227488a7e1e37", "ja": "はいはーい！　だったら、私も脱いじゃいまーす！\nこれで二肌だよね？", "zh": "好啦好啦！既然这样，我也来脱一把——！这样就是双份助力了，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1086_021mat", "source_sha256": "7aa03397bf4f1eb093c65e03c8c9bcffff5b839017dbcddeb717d8748367a4fb", "ja": "みんなで協力するのです！　では……コホン。\nいいですか？　少女漫画なら、こういう場合……。", "zh": "大家一起合作吧！那么……咳咳。\n听好了吗？如果是少女漫画，遇到这种情况……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1087_021mat", "source_sha256": "a5ff060c6f790bb62f4f9dcc0d087c044d705fe8f9fe5b49b60da39ff1eb869d", "ja": "仲間の後押しで、はっぴー！なエンドを迎えるのです。\nだから姫たちも……ね？", "zh": "在伙伴们的助力下，就能迎来幸福的结局啦。  \n所以，公主们也……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1088_009rit", "source_sha256": "6dec6f2ee66f0a75714c486d807cd77c0d2513e1b1926c8e90a1fb22b2113f7e", "ja": "風花さんは大人だし、普段なら放っておくんだけど……\n今回ばかりは、私たちも協力しましょうか！", "zh": "风花已经是大人了，平时我会放着不管……但这次，就让我们也来帮忙吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1089_p", "source_sha256": "df0bde73cbcb6fa29c27037546e5ed0ac3c879e88e6adaef7d36268c61cf7df0", "ja": "（やれやれ、やっと終わったな。\nこの後は予定もないし、風花に連絡を……）", "zh": "（真是的，总算结束了。之后也没什么安排，联系一下风花吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1090_se", "source_sha256": "b12709ece634544d32af67a926a9d0555729b694be2ce9963a7d8ef771034632", "ja": "プルルルル……", "zh": "嘟噜噜噜噜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1091_p", "source_sha256": "484ed85287b472e6080c5cbdc3b2779a45cb12d9a3fb4a5110df8682d236bdab", "ja": "わっ！？　……あれ、律子から電話だ。\nもしもし、お疲れさま。どうかしたのか？", "zh": "哇！？……咦，是律子打来的电话。\n喂，你辛苦了。怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1092_009rit", "source_sha256": "cdada63888522ea71c53210d22f775fc23f316be8a9def616c9b4d8ac352ec81", "ja": "『{$P$}！\n今、大丈夫ですか？』", "zh": "『{$P$}！\n现在方便说话吗？』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1093_009rit", "source_sha256": "933840b8f398dfeff3cb5c3d5fc97297665fbdfb39c16580890b5d6a2b17912b", "ja": "『風花さんが、大変なんです！　私たちでは\nどうにもできなくて……すぐに来てください！』", "zh": "『风花姐出事了！我们实在没办法……请您马上过来！』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1094_p", "source_sha256": "b98d82052987f2512afa2f9acb3498e3161bad7b98725d01543349b7b46dc944", "ja": "ええっ、風花が！？　すぐに戻る！", "zh": "诶，风花！？我马上回去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1095_se", "source_sha256": "05ad9e6ec41f26d822d7b608538b18bed0c18ed2a49ac5093b14bf064c44634b", "ja": "バタバタバタ……ガチャッ！", "zh": "扑通扑通扑通……咔嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1096_041fuk", "source_sha256": "05f80c5341c68fd9ce6f8c293abb189386a7815603d438a6f3d06bb924820835", "ja": "キャッ！？　……{$P$}さん？", "zh": "呀！？……{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1097_p", "source_sha256": "a4852ad54f1fe307e9f2184e909dc011636f2414f6fa5a36635b44c3216ef818", "ja": "だ、大丈夫か、風花！\n大変な事が起きたって、一体……！？", "zh": "风、风花，你没事吧！\n你说发生了不得了的事，到底……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1098_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3bb20ddc60c350bd90f14552c5632c0ca0a1d4bbc2534e16f98d35dafda7d80b", "ja": "大変なことって……あっ！\nもしかして、急病人ですか？　救急車は……。", "zh": "出大事了是指……啊！\n难道是有突发急病的患者吗？救护车叫了吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1099_p", "source_sha256": "48fb35a7fbca1865bbe360bfcbf47eda95dc27040904d6927fccd0dc1474073f", "ja": "いや、急病の人はいない……かな？\nそれより、風花が大変だって聞いたんだけど。", "zh": "不，应该没有突发急病的人……吧？\n比起这个，我听说风花你遇到大麻烦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1100_041fuk", "source_sha256": "75e442e08e325f3828f5d805193d15edede78d47fef88250bcd13bed62024145", "ja": "私が？　いえ、大変なことは何も……。\nあ、新曲を覚えるのは少し大変ですけど……。", "zh": "我？不，没什么大变故……。\n啊，要记新歌倒是有点费劲……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1101_p", "source_sha256": "d7bab6d7e22fa5f98c5cd44ae6ae501191cd7ff248d89e1e9b6744dd26291fda", "ja": "そ、そうか。……あれ？\n風花、律子たちは一緒じゃ……。", "zh": "是、是吗。……咦？\n风花、律子她们没和你一起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1103_p", "source_sha256": "3c36567b09584f04e05928b317fe88a6af7f8a7263da122aca0ef686625012c1", "ja": "あ、メールだ。……まつりから？", "zh": "啊，来邮件了。……是小祭发来的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1104_021mat", "source_sha256": "e5ecfe985c0e7ed1b61d8539aea2fc091378f0ff84cb90bac5b77fb812c15373", "ja": "『ここからは、ナイト様におまかせなのです♪\nちゃんとエスコートしなくちゃ、めっ！なのですよ』", "zh": "『接下来就交给骑士大人了哦♪\n如果不好好护送人家的话，可是要挨训的呢』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1105_041fuk", "source_sha256": "360ce859d916cd4486a659a50fb3549ab2217b15fcc7b4c22a7086d6ed6724a9", "ja": "あの……{$P$}さん？\nどういうことなんでしょう？", "zh": "那个……{$P$}先生？\n这到底是怎么回事呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1106_p", "source_sha256": "e7e15924e02320e11fa990c19ba2256582c7257525dc53ccb9a662997495e7e6", "ja": "ああ……今わかったよ。\nどうやらみんなが、チャンスをくれたみたいだ。", "zh": "啊……我现在明白了。\n看来大家是给了我一个机会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1107_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ae1f76d66e5a065ebb26d1087248b7c75635f453aa375fedf90704306ab9fc18", "ja": "チャンスって……あっ！", "zh": "机会……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1108_p", "source_sha256": "dc0e651391c689d876dba91ee736e7c10951750ee889cfcc64dcc7da953a20b2", "ja": "でも、良かったよ。\n電話やメールでもよかったんだけど……。", "zh": "不过，太好了。\n其实打电话或发邮件也可以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1109_p", "source_sha256": "3bd4fd7b013ff73120c809349760ac6749aa67f62002115ff6dd1737ad6666ea", "ja": "本当は、直接会って話した方がいいと思ってたから。\nみんなに感謝しないとだな。", "zh": "其实，我一直觉得还是当面见面聊比较好。\n得好好感谢大家才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1110_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a443728a8175b991932eba7c1377a7feb90b5c05a89ee687339a5281a0ed75e9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1111_p", "source_sha256": "c9e160ed63afaba3ae88d4cc3576569027dd14334d64d34e8c03fb3cb7a8ad90", "ja": "風花、新しい仕事の事なんだけど……。", "zh": "风花，关于新工作的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1113_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9ec69021d6e1ee42540f1c4b965d5a3d4f061d669424f28f25897f5dfc44f01f", "ja": "じゃあ本当に、女性誌のお話だったんですか！？\nで、でも、水着の撮影があるか聞いてましたよね？", "zh": "那这么说，真的是女性杂志的工作吗！？\n可、可是，你刚才不是还问有没有泳装拍摄吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1114_p", "source_sha256": "8f0fa78465c256f04114e4c0eb1cab4d07ca379f6a7606e4f361765c7c7d81e9", "ja": "ああ、確認してたんだ。\nもし水着の撮影があるなら、断ろうと思って。", "zh": "啊，我是在确认这件事。\n如果有泳装拍摄的话，我本来想拒绝的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1115_041fuk", "source_sha256": "43f5d8c56e03403fbcf2a2d9187afc2a265becc82026459ea78e9d8c69c3f00e", "ja": "そうだったんですか……じゃあやっぱり、\n私がひとりで勝手に勘違いして、怒って……。", "zh": "原来是这样啊……那果然是我一个人擅自误会了，还发了脾气……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1116_041fuk", "source_sha256": "626087607ffe6410198fd57f8c4d356dc0fe5aa3f6de03898e6e830b8a538cec", "ja": "{$P$}さん、ごめんなさい！\n私ったら、ちゃんと話を聞きもしないで……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，对不起！\n我真是的，连话都没好好听完就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1117_p", "source_sha256": "af6a49a556b666b88073df7f6c5263b20250bc2d3842d4d6baa5ad1121dffc25", "ja": "いや、謝るのはこっちの方だよ。苦手な水着の仕事も\n引き受けてくれて、いつも助かってる。", "zh": "不，该道歉的是我才对。连不擅长的泳装工作\n你也愿意接下，一直以来都帮了我大忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1118_p", "source_sha256": "86ed16bb2e0129ff0fc9a505397a31f0a8c6b0d8ea8079d0bf830aa40780d8b1", "ja": "今回のオファーは、働く大人の女性向けの雑誌なんだ。\n女性の好感度が高い風花に、ぴったりだと思う。", "zh": "这次的邀约，是面向职场成熟女性的杂志。  \n我觉得很适合女性好感度很高的风花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1119_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6ed9c61f591143b8dd247e58a1aaceb7442158dba68b9cc2ac0960b89e052db6", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\n私のこと、ちゃんと考えて……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……请好好考虑一下我……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1120_p", "source_sha256": "4fa981898567f3106fdd479eb460fc1c1096d106cbba4d494f11fcff52f4a3b9", "ja": "改めて、相談させてほしい。\n女性誌のオファー、引き受けてもいいか？", "zh": "我想再认真和你商量一下。\n女性杂志的邀约，可以接下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_092_1121_041fuk", "source_sha256": "44f05e7e0cb4a8e75de2b69a801f0f014205255e01446db3e15df3d128cdc88b", "ja": "は、はいっ！　もちろんです！", "zh": "是、是的！当然可以！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
